{{Documentation|self_doc=true}}
This template displays Cat deploy images given a list of Cat names. The template differentiates forms, and there is no limit (realistically) to the number of Cats that can be listed.

==Example==
<tabber>
Default=
<pre>
{{CatIcon|Cat|Eraser Cat|Ryu CC|D'artanyan|Malevolent Mad-Duck|Cheetah Cat}}
</pre>

===Result===
{{CatIcon|Cat|Eraser Cat|Ryu CC|D'artanyan|Malevolent Mad-Duck|Cheetah Cat}}
|-|
Sized=
<pre>
{{CatIcon|Cat|Eraser Cat|Ryu CC|D'artanyan|Malevolent Mad-Duck|Cheetah Cat|size=80px}}
</pre>

===Result===
{{CatIcon|Cat|Eraser Cat|Ryu CC|D'artanyan|Malevolent Mad-Duck|Cheetah Cat|size=80px}}
</tabber>